<title>RUSSIA: Russian firm to audit central bank 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Russian firm to audit central bank 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Duma lower house of Russian parliament has approved Russia's UNIKON/MS consulting group to audit the results of central bank activities in 1996, Duma officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Other contenders for the audit were Deloitte Touche Tohmatsu International, Price Waterhouse, Ernst &amp; Young and several Russian firms.</p>
<p>Deloitte Touche audited last year's results.</p>
<p>A Duma document obtained by Reuters said UNIKON's services would cost $320,000.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
